outboundDialog.desc:
Services in the preset catalog are brokered by Composio:
· tool arguments and results travel through their servers;
· OAuth tokens are stored on their side, not on this machine;
· they keep execution logs (including payloads) for up to a year by default — switch Log storage to “Don't store data” under Settings → General in the Composio dashboard now.
Continuing means you accept this data path.
